      "en": "Then he brought me back by the way of the outer gate of the sanctuary, which looks toward the east; and it was shut.",
      "ko": "그가 나를 데리고 성소 동향한 바깥 문에 돌아오시니 그 문이 닫히었더라",
      "source_text_hash": "4d0a613af998daad22d04fde30efdce34fa6cddc3b716f3dee5f71e630402e67",
      "translation_text_hash": "4faa966083dfb1a9db48129ce32a6e314f6b40a97b00d1bba3a90de68b8f7b28",
