      "en": "“They shall enter into my sanctuary, and they shall come near to my table, to minister to me, and they shall keep my instruction.",
      "ko": "그들이 내 성소에 들어오며 또 내 상에 가까이 나아와 내게 수종들어 나의 맡긴 직분을 지키되",
      "source_text_hash": "a19272c3ba0ad2fa7f5a45690235d9b0c93d60c43b1e65c9b1f334d2551dca8f",
