      ],
      "en": "They shall have linen turbans on their heads, and shall have linen trousers on their waists. They shall not clothe themselves with anything that makes them sweat.",
      "ko": "가는베 관을 머리에 쓰며 가는베 바지를 입고 땀 나게 하는 것으로 허리를 동이지 말 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "02c07c1ba9954092943d928ce9637ee2aed01f2686f4405d68efa6406c7d2257",
      "translation_text_hash": "42ff15da5a63fe4a1f4a0f0d1c45c5b89bd2499cc9688d397ad10545af499144",
