      "en": "“‘“They shall not shave their heads, or allow their locks to grow long. They shall only cut off the hair of their heads.",
      "ko": "그들은 또 머리털을 밀지도 말며 머리털을 길게 자라게도 말고 그 머리털을 깎기만 할 것이며",
      "source_text_hash": "af07170954a607721fb6d219189f6487b41539e52d8b420149ae9166669ec426",
      "translation_text_hash": "e2a9123b0667cbc30d826a8c6f6e15b4f9979f000cc9bfdb3c7ad4835f215110",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
